    "created_at": "2026-05-18T14:09:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-18T14:09:44Z",
    "body": "@ngosang since adding to \"best list\" yesterday the poor server has went from super good to super bad :) it is on a couple other lists but your list put it over the top.  We were processing about 53 million announces a day within less than 100ms response but now most are unanswered.  The workload has quadrupled.  We were processing around 800-1200 packets a sec, now its being sent around 3700 packets a sec.\n\nWe are working through the issues seeing if we can accommodate this new traffic.  Just thought i'd give you a heads up if your curious why the server seems dead.  Putting in metric timings to see if we can pinpoint where the issues are.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
