    "updated_at": "2026-05-18T14:37:16Z",
    "body": "The codebase will never be able to compete with opentracker, simply not designed to do that.  It was originally built as a private server tracker.  Of which in its current state i'm sure would be sufficient. Would support a userbase of a few hundred thousand members pretty easily I would think.\n\nYour servers are processing a lot of traffic!",
