    "updated_at": "2026-05-18T22:22:36Z",
    "body": "I feel in general the legitimate traffic reaching the server and processing is smaller today than when the server was not on best list.  The overall announce traffic is smaller than when not on best list.  I am dropping more traffic at the door, but the amount of traffic is around 2800 packets per second vs yesterday 700-1200 packets per second.  The bulk of this traffic is purely udp connect and nothing else.  The client does not perform another action.\n\nWhen I personally test tracker it is replying with correct data though.  Is very strange to me this traffic.",
