    "body": "我用wireshark找出了一些在30秒内持续重复请求的客户端\n由于客户端的定时请求特性，也没办法用黑名单真正的屏蔽他们，始终会收到他们的请求流量，他们并不接受来自tracker服务器响应的更新间隔，唯一能够做的就是对这些客户端拒绝回复响应\n\n所有Transmission/4.1.0及后续版本\n每20秒请求一次更新\n<img width=\"1680\" height=\"1312\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3ddaa7bf-95c2-4008-992d-849e5ed69d5b\" />\n\n<img width=\"1681\" height=\"1315\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/471575ef-7443-4e63-8b7f-1659f07b6140\" />\n\n<img width=\"1681\" height=\"1316\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e747270d-de18-49ab-b107-c273a213d563\" />\n\n<img width=\"1680\" height=\"1315\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e5b6adb-a7e2-4ecf-9424-e2467608ee13\" />\n\n<img width=\"1677\" height=\"1312\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a39ec153-abdf-42d8-8e01-bdb3802eb8e3\" />\n\n<img width=\"1681\" height=\"1314\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bc1831b4-9bd3-4711-8cdd-064c68701578\" />\n\n\nKTorrent/25.4.2\n每秒请求5次更新，从抓包上看，并不是一个真实客户端，应该是攻击爬虫\n<img width=\"1684\" height=\"1317\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d4281a25-d629-4639-b7bd-2885cf64e486\" />\n\n<img width=\"1676\" height=\"1318\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/014a76ab-62a4-4a94-9026-6768c7d41bd7\" />\n\nanacrolix-torrent/v1.60.1-0.20251217073903-486bcbe758e0\n每2秒请求一次，一直在更新、停止，这样循环\n<img width=\"1674\" height=\"1310\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/375c1a38-0fcc-4a8c-980b-661a783d98ef\" />\n\n<img width=\"1684\" height=\"1311\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/374ad412-511a-40ee-8c33-b4e13be6c87d\" />\n",
